abstract: >-
  MARS is an open community standard for isolate-level
  antimicrobial resistance surveillance data.

  It defines a minimal mandatory data model, canonical
  identifier mappings, controlled vocabularies, and a
  machine-readable agent access interface - all in one
  versioned, citable artefact.
